   
Windows operating system does not accept "*" in file name;
for that reason some svn-stored basis set files with "star" in name are
copied into files with "*" in names, what is their proper quantum chemical notation.

    svn-stored      --->      copied
-------------------------------------------------------
    3-21++G-star             3-21++G*
    3-21G-star               3-21G*
    6-311+G-star             6-311+G*
    6-311G-star              6-311G*
    6-311++G-star-star       6-311++G**
    6-311G-star-star         6-311G**
    6-31++G-star             6-31++G*
    6-31+G-star              6-31+G*
    6-31G-star               6-31G*
    6-31++G-star-star        6-31++G**
    6-31G-star-star          6-31G**
 
